{"id":"propast_","lemma":"пропасть","pos":"verb","rank":4434,"glosses":["to get lost, to be done","to disappear, to vanish","to lose, to fail"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6e/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C%C2%B01.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C%C2%B01.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"пропаду","2s":"пропадёшь","3s":"пропадёт","1p":"пропадём","2p":"пропадёте","3p":"пропадут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"пропади","2p":"пропадите"}}},"past":{"m":"пропал","p":"пропали","f":"пропала","n":"пропало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"пропадать","examples":[{"text":"Маленький мальчик пропал в лесу.","en":"The little boy was lost in the forest.","words":[{"g":"little, small"},{"g":"boy"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"forest, woods","l":"лес"}]},{"text":"Что пропало, то пропало.","en":"What's lost is lost.","words":[{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"У них пропала собака.","en":"They lost their dog.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},null,null,{"g":"dog"}]},{"text":"В таком случае я пропал.","en":"Then that means I lost everything.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,null,{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Все мои вещи пропали.","en":"All of my things are gone.","words":[{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"thing, object","l":"вещь"},null]}]}